# Optional. Copy to /etc/vps-infra/backup-include.conf on a host to back up paths
# beyond the defaults. One path per line, globs allowed, # starts a comment.
#
# Already included automatically, do NOT list them again:
#   /etc/vps-infra              (config + credentials)
#   /data/coolify               (Coolify control plane, incl. APP_KEY + deploy keys)
#   /etc/dokploy                (Dokploy control plane)
#   /opt/vps-infra              (staged compose files)
#   /opt/*/docker-compose.yml   (per-stack compose)
#   every named docker volume, tarred
#   pg_dumpall / mysqldump of every running database container
#
# Examples:
# /srv/uploads
# /etc/letsencrypt
# /opt/neobank/secrets/*.json
